(Section A ? Cloud Service Description) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(The Cloud Service is Quillhub Route Optimizer Enterprise, a cloud-based) Tj
T*
(logistics-optimization platform providing real-time route planning, fleet) Tj
T*
(tracking, delivery-window management, and API integration services \(the) Tj
T*
("Platform"\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section B ? Subscription Period and Renewal) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(  Effective Date:              September 15, 2026) Tj
T*
(  Initial Subscription Period: 36 months \(ending September 14, 2029\)) Tj
T*
(  Renewal Period:              successive 24-month periods) Tj
T*
(  Non-Renewal Notice Period:   180 days before the end of the then-current) Tj
T*
(                               Subscription Period) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  The Agreement will automatically renew for successive Renewal Periods of) Tj
T*
(  24 months each, unless either party delivers written notice of non-renewal) Tj
T*
(  to the other party's Notice Address at least 180 days before the end of the) Tj
T*
(  then-current Subscription Period, in accordance with Section 5.1 of the) Tj
T*
(  Standard Terms.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section C ? Fees and Payment) Tj
