T*
(  Monthly Fee:     $40,000.00 \(Forty Thousand U.S. Dollars\)) Tj
T*
(  Payment Process: Invoicing. Quillhub will issue invoices on the first) Tj
T*
(                   business day of each calendar month for that month's Fee.) Tj
T*
(  Payment Period:  45 days from invoice date.) Tj
T*
(  Currency:        U.S. Dollars) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  Annual Fee Adjustment: Beginning with the second year of the Subscription) Tj
T*
(  Period, the Monthly Fee will increase by three percent \(3%\) on each) Tj
T*
(  anniversary of the Effective Date. For clarity, the Monthly Fee for the) Tj
T*
(  period beginning September 15, 2027 will be $41,200.00.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section D ? Service Level) Tj
T*
(--------------------------) Tj
T*
(  з3.1  Uptime Commitment. Quillhub will make the Platform available at least) Tj
T*
(        ninety-nine and nine-tenths percent \(99.9%\) of the minutes in each) Tj
T*
(        calendar month, not counting Scheduled Maintenance \(the "Harbor Uptime) Tj
T*
(        Target"\). "Scheduled Maintenance" means maintenance that Quillhub has) Tj
T*
(        notified Harbor Retail about at least 72 hours in advance via email to) Tj
T*
(        the Customer's contact. Scheduled Maintenance windows will not exceed) Tj
T*
(        two \(2\) hours per occurrence and will not be scheduled more than once) Tj
T*
(        per calendar month.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  з3.2  Uptime Measurement. "Monthly Uptime Percentage" means the total) Tj
T*
(        number of minutes in a calendar month minus the number of Downtime) Tj
T*
(        Minutes, divided by the total number of minutes in that calendar) Tj
T*
(        month, expressed as a percentage. "Downtime Minutes" means the total) Tj
T*
(        number of minutes during which the Platform is unavailable, excluding) Tj
T*
(        Scheduled Maintenance.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  з3.3  Service Credits. If the Monthly Uptime Percentage falls below the) Tj
T*
(        Harbor Uptime Target in any calendar month, Quillhub will credit) Tj
T*
(        Harbor Retail fifteen percent \(15%\) of the Monthly Fee for that month) Tj
T*
(        against Harbor Retail's next invoice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  з3.4  Credit Cap. The total service credits for any single calendar month) Tj
T*
(        will not exceed twenty percent \(20%\) of the Monthly Fee for that month.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  з3.5  Credit Request. Harbor Retail must request a service credit in writing) Tj
T*
(        within forty-five \(45\) days after the end of the calendar month in) Tj
T*
(        which the Downtime occurred.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section E ? Incident Response) Tj
T*
(------------------------------) Tj
T*
(  з4.1  Incident Notification. If Quillhub becomes aware of any unplanned) Tj
T*
(        service disruption affecting the Platform, Quillhub will notify Harbor) Tj
T*
(        Retail's contact \(nora.chen@harborretail.com\) within four \(4\) hours) Tj
T*
(        of becoming aware of the disruption.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  з4.2  Incident Reports. For any unplanned Downtime exceeding thirty \(30\)) Tj
T*
(        minutes, Quillhub will provide a written root-cause analysis to) Tj
T*
(        Harbor Retail within five \(5\) business days after service is restored.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section F ? Data Protection) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------) Tj
T*
(  з5.1  Data Breach Notification. If Quillhub becomes aware of any actual or) Tj
T*
(        reasonably suspected unauthorized access to, or unauthorized) Tj
T*
(        acquisition, disclosure, use, or loss of, Harbor Retail's data) Tj
T*
(        \("Data Breach"\), Quillhub will notify Harbor Retail's General Counsel) Tj
T*
(        within twenty-four \(24\) hours of becoming aware of the Data Breach.) Tj
T*
(        This obligation is in addition to and does not replace the Security) Tj
ET

