(Section G ? Exclusivity) Tj
T*
(-------------------------) Tj
T*
(  з6.1  Route Optimizer Exclusivity. During the Subscription Period, Quillhub) Tj
T*
(        grants Harbor Retail the exclusive right to use the Route Optimizer) Tj
T*
(        Enterprise platform within the Pacific Northwest retail grocery) Tj
T*
(        sector \(defined as retail grocery operations headquartered in the) Tj
T*
(        states of Washington and Oregon\). Quillhub will not license Route) Tj
T*
(        Optimizer Enterprise to any other retail grocery company headquartered) Tj
T*
(        in Washington or Oregon during the Subscription Period without Harbor) Tj
T*
(        Retail's prior written consent.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section H ? Insurance Requirement) Tj
T*
(-----------------------------------) Tj
T*
(  з7.1  Provider Insurance. Quillhub will maintain, at its own expense and) Tj
T*
(        throughout the Subscription Period, the following insurance coverage:) Tj
T*
(        \(a\) Commercial General Liability insurance with limits of at least) Tj
T*
(        $2,000,000 per occurrence; and \(b\) Technology Errors & Omissions and) Tj
T*
(        Cyber Liability insurance with limits of at least $3,000,000 per) Tj
T*
(        claim. Quillhub will provide certificates of insurance to Harbor) Tj
T*
(        Retail upon request within ten \(10\) business days.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  з7.2  Lapse Notification. If any required insurance policy is cancelled,) Tj
T*
(        materially reduced, or not renewed, Quillhub will notify Harbor) Tj
T*
(        Retail in writing within five \(5\) business days. A lapse in required) Tj
T*
(        insurance coverage constitutes a material breach of this Agreement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section I ? Termination) Tj
T*
(-------------------------) Tj
T*
(  з8.1  Termination for Persistent SLA Failures. If the Monthly Uptime) Tj
T*
(        Percentage falls below the Harbor Uptime Target in any two \(2\)) Tj
T*
(        consecutive calendar months, Harbor Retail may terminate this) Tj
T*
(        Agreement upon written notice to Quillhub. In such event, Quillhub) Tj
T*
(        will refund to Harbor Retail a prorated portion of any prepaid Fees) Tj
T*
(        for the remainder of the Subscription Period.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  з8.2  Termination for Insurance Lapse. If Quillhub fails to maintain the) Tj
T*
(        insurance required by Section 7 and does not cure the lapse within) Tj
T*
(        fifteen \(15\) days after written notice from Harbor Retail, Harbor) Tj
T*
(        Retail may terminate this Agreement immediately upon written notice.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Section J ? Liability) Tj
T*
(-----------------------) Tj
T*
(  General Cap Amount:  The total Fees paid or payable by Customer in the) Tj
T*
(                       twelve \(12\) months immediately preceding the claim.) Tj
T*
(  Unlimited Claims:    Data Breach obligations under Section 5;) Tj
T*
(                       Customer's breach of Section 2.1 of the Standard Terms) Tj
T*
(                       \(Restrictions on Customer\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
